<section class="cta-section relative isolate overflow-hidden py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 via-indigo-500 to-pink-500">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

    <p class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-white/20 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white ring-1 ring-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm">
      Try the product
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
      まずはデモで体験してみてください
    </h2>
    <p class="text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
      実際のデータで動作するデモ環境を公開しています。<br />
      AIチャット、プロフィール管理、申請フローをすぐに試せます。
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href="https://employee-profile-app-184e1.web.app/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-white text-slate-950 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-cyan-50 transition-colors text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/15 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
